From: Lumi firmware maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] name the WLAN module aic8800 to match the board loader

The source keeps its upstream directory name; the loadable module uses the
board report's name. Do not override MODULE_NAME globally: the loader module
must retain aic_load_fw.

--- a/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/Makefile
+++ b/USB/driver_fw/drivers/aic8800/aic8800_fdrv/Makefile
@@ -8 +8 @@
-MODULE_NAME = aic8800_fdrv
+MODULE_NAME = aic8800
